          "message": {
            "text": "GET /secure/ssrf: Outbound destination needs SSRF review [needs_evidence]. Scan identified a request-derived value reaching the destination operand of fetch: query.fetch, req.headers.host. Destination control, restriction and coverage are assessed as separate facets; request data sent as a body or header is not destination control. SSRF assessment: destination control path_or_query, restriction none, coverage incomplete. Scanner policy: The request controls only the path or query of a fixed host according to the assessment; that is not destination host control and no SSRF status is claimed. Review the target API for path-based effects separately."
          },
